# Astro

Follow `.agents/skills/astro/SKILL.md` when adding pages, layouts, or interactive islands.

Hard rules:

- Prefer `.astro` for routing, layouts, and static content (zero JS by default)
- Use React only for interactivity; never turn the app into a client SPA
- Always pick an explicit `client:*` directive when hydrating — do not default everything to `client:load`
- Fetch data in Astro frontmatter when possible; keep secrets off the client
- Keep `i18n.locales` / `defaultLocale` in sync with `src/i18n/config.ts` and `src/pages/<locale>/`
